WEBVTT

00:04:29.307 --> 00:04:33.894
I've amassed almost 15 million subscribers
and three billion views.

00:04:34.353 --> 00:04:36.605
But more important than all of that,

00:04:36.605 --> 00:04:38.649
I managed to change one view.

00:04:39.525 --> 00:04:42.820
I challenged my grandfather's
entrenched gender beliefs.

00:04:43.237 --> 00:04:46.532
And for the first time in my life,
I remember thinking in that moment,

00:04:46.574 --> 00:04:49.076
“Oh, I finally got
a seat at the table ...”

00:04:49.076 --> 00:04:50.119
Hello, props.

00:04:50.244 --> 00:04:51.537
(Laughter)

00:04:51.537 --> 00:04:54.206
" ... alongside the men in the industry.”

00:04:54.248 --> 00:04:55.583
I felt like that.

00:04:56.375 --> 00:04:59.003
And encouraged
by my grandfather's approval,

00:04:59.003 --> 00:05:01.547
I became more confident in my influence.